(Jan Odijk:)\\
Notice that the values of the attributes  mood, superdeixis, req
of the record of T1 are NOT copied onto  the record of the PREPP. It is assumed
that this is done at substitution. The shift rules must be sensitive to 
wh-NPVARs inside VARPREPPs.
